    <CATEGORY Name="PreMenu">
        <Entry Name="WelcomeMessage01">Welcome to Amnesia: The Dark Descent! [br][br]What follows be a couple o' quick messages on how to get the best possible experience.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="WelcomeMessage02">Amnesia should not be played to win. [br][br]Instead, focus on immersin' yerself in the game's world and story.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="WelcomeMessage03">Do not worry about when and how to save durin' gameplay, the game will take care o' that fer ye. [br][br]When ye want to leave the game, just choose "Save and Exit". Shiver me timbers, ye can then use "Continue" to return to where ye left off next time ye start up the game.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="WelcomeMessage04">The world o' Amnesia be a dangerous place and ye be extremely vulnerable. [br][br]Do not try to fight the enemies encountered. Instead, use yer wits. Hide, or even run if necessary.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="WelcomeMessage05">The interplay between light and dark be mighty important to the game and because o' this it be vital to set up the gamma correctly. Use the slider control below to do so. Adjust it until the square at the right be barely visible. [br][br]Also make sure to play in a dark room and wear headphones fer the best effect.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="WelcomeMessage06">That be all. Hope ye enjoy immersin' yerself in the world o' Amnesia.[br][br][br]- Frictional Games</Entry>
    </CATEGORY>
